# bad/wrong-kind.aon --- typed endpoints in miniature: refer(t)
# unifies t INTO the target, so a database endpoint collides.
# Deliberately self-contained -- the same typed refer on the full
# model fails with [aontu/unify_cycle] (README, gap 8).
@"std/system"
std: hide({})

infra: paydb: kind: database

app: ledger: kind: service
app: ledger: dependsOn: [&: refer($.std.Service) path($.infra.paydb)]
